      "sourceTime": "00:27-00:32",
      "html": "<section class=\"section contact-section\" id=\"contact\" data-section-id=\"contact\" aria-labelledby=\"contact-title\">\n        <div class=\"contact-aside\">\n          <p class=\"section-kicker\">Specialist form / 00:27-00:32</p>\n          <h2 id=\"contact-title\">Connect with an X Ads specialist</h2>\n          <p>The original backend and private form structure are not available, so this local form recreates the observed two-column layout and adds accessible validation.</p>\n          <div class=\"map-lines\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 480 260\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\">\n              <ellipse cx=\"180\" cy=\"10\" rx=\"210\" ry=\"150\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 9\" opacity=\".35\"/>\n              <path d=\"M292 -20L386 250M316 -20L410 250M340 -20L434 250M0 170L480 50\" opacity=\".4\"/>\n              <circle cx=\"371\" cy=\"145\" r=\"20\" fill=\"var(--color-bg)\" stroke=\"currentColor\" opacity=\".6\"/>\n              <circle cx=\"371\" cy=\"145\" r=\"3\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\"/>\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <form class=\"contact-form\" data-contact-form novalidate>\n          <label>\n            <span>First name *</span>\n            <input name=\"firstName\" autocomplete=\"given-name\" required aria-describedby=\"first-name-error\">\n            <small id=\"first-name-error\"></small>\n          </label>\n          <label>\n            <span>Last name *</span>\n            <input name=\"lastName\" autocomplete=\"family-name\" required aria-describedby=\"last-name-error\">\n            <small id=\"last-name-error\"></small>\n          </label>\n          <label>\n            <span>Business email *</span>\n            <input name=\"email\" type=\"email\" autocomplete=\"email\" required aria-describedby=\"email-error\">\n            <small id=\"email-error\"></small>\n          </label>\n          <label>\n            <span>Company *</span>\n            <input name=\"company\" autocomplete=\"organization\" required aria-describedby=\"company-error\">\n            <small id=\"company-error\"></small>\n          </label>\n          <label>\n            <span>Company handle</span>\n            <input name=\"handle\" placeholder=\"@company\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n          </label>\n          <label>\n            <span>Phone number</span>\n            <input name=\"phone\" type=\"tel\" autocomplete=\"tel\">\n          </label>\n          <label>\n            <span>Preferred payment method</span>\n            <select name=\"payment\"><option value=\"\">Select a method</option><option>Card</option><option>Other / discuss with support</option></select>\n          </label>\n          <label>\n            <span>Country</span>\n            <select name=\"country\" autocomplete=\"country-name\"><option value=\"\">Select a country</option><option>South Korea</option><option>United States</option><option>Other</option></select>\n          </label>\n          <label class=\"full\">\n            <span>Monthly ad budget</span>\n            <select name=\"budget\">\n              <option>Under $1,000</option>\n              <option>$1,000-$10,000</option>\n              <option>$10,000+</option>\n            </select>\n          </label>\n          <label class=\"full\">\n            <span>What do you want to promote?</span>\n            <textarea name=\"message\" rows=\"4\"></textarea>\n          </label>\n          <div class=\"form-actions full\">\n            <button class=\"button button-primary\" type=\"submit\" aria-busy=\"false\">Get started</button>\n            <p class=\"form-status\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\">No external request is made. Validation runs locally.</p>\n          </div>\n        </form>\n      </section>",
